      "known_limits": [
        "i_harmonize fails on ordinary 2D matrices because compute_knn includes an extra subscript. Select the separately declared earlier source profile explicitly for the tested historical path.",
        "map_cells_knn_big default method vector errors in this selected R version; explicit scalar methods are project caller choices.",
        "impute_cross_big defaults reference a caller object impute.dat.list; omitted defaults are not repaired.",
        "The original Parquet constructor accesses sparse matrix slots directly. Supply the intended dgCMatrix explicitly; dense matrices are not silently converted.",
        "The original Parquet constructor fails when the last cell bin has one column, including the tested 50001-cell input at col.bin.size=50000. Do not pad or remove cells to conceal the failure."
      ]
    },
